   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Enhancing Awareness and Capacity Building for Public Service Transformation in Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of E-goverment by setting up a Smart Campus Platform and improvement of the quality of public administration service with a coherent e-government system through the ministries in Cameroon&#x25a3;  &#xc804;&#xc790;&#xc815;&#xbd80; &#xc778;&#xc2dd; &#xac15;&#xd654; &#xbc0f; &#xc81c;&#xb3c4;&#xae30;&#xbc18; &#xb9c8;&#xb828;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transformation of the mindset of public officials through trainings related e-goverment, Rasining recognition on e-government by setting up smart classroom in 3 government higher institutions(ENAM, ISMP,SUPPTIC) and promotion of digital transfromation</narrative>
  </description>
